{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46123","headline":"对雪寄新定冯使君二首 一 · 贯休","name":"对雪寄新定冯使君二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙掌空思归未能，焚香冥目对残灯。\n岂知瑞雪千山合，空觉春寒半夜增。\n翳月素云埋粉堞，堆巢孤鹤下金绳。\n因思太守忧民切，吟对琼枝喜不胜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}